                                                "sense_id": "7ff239a5-de95-3b4c-af91-3423edb6eed7",
                                                "text": "Calm on the seas, and silver sleep,\n⁠And waves that sway themselves in rest,\n⁠And dead calm in that noble breast\nWhich heaves but with the heaving deep."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2f838e1f-b56e-32e3-be32-97b28b538987",
